      "Tel:\t\t\tXXXXXX",
      "E-mail：\t\tXXXXXX",
      "Date:\t\t\tDD.MM.YYYY",
      "To the Embassy of India, Beijing:",
      "I am a citizen of India, and I hold the position of XXXX(Department) at XXXXXX(Indian Company Name). I would like to invite my partner – XXXXXX(Applicant Name) from XXXXXX(Chinese Company Name).  Add: XXXXXX, P.R. China(Chinese Company Address) to visit our company from 16/03/2026 to 03/04/2026 for XXXXXX(Business Purpose).",
      "The invitee information is as follows:",
      "During his visit, their company will be responsible for all his costs including the round trip airplane tickets, food, medical insurance and all the other expenses.",
      "I am aware of India Immigration policy and will ensure that he understand the conditions and requirements of his staying in India. I make sure that he will obey the local laws and leave India before the expiration of his authorized stay.",
      "Please kindly consider about granting him the Temporary Resident Visa. It will be greatly appreciated to get the updates from you soon.",
      "If any additional information or clarifications are needed, please feel free to call me.",
      "Sincerely,",
      "XXXXXX(Indian Company Name)",
      "Signature of the inviter：",
      "Mr./Ms.XXXXXXXXXX",
      "XXXX(Occupation)"
